From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 12:22:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add Docker deployment: Dockerfile, docker-compose, HOST
 env var support

- Dockerfile: python:3.11-slim base with GDAL/GEOS/PROJ system libs,
  installs requirements.txt then the package editable
- docker-compose.yml: maps port 5050, mounts config.yaml as a volume
  (edit language/country without rebuild), persists uploads in a named volume
- app.py: HOST and PORT env vars override config.yaml values so the
  container can bind to 0.0.0.0 without editing config.yaml
- README: new Docker section (option 1), local install demoted to options 2/3,
  docker-compose files added to project structure listing

